{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_071_1000_p", "source_sha256": "51c9cc0a86fa67b383bc1a6236d11d2c1eb8960cafdea9a1153d2571095bd9a7", "ja": "（美希の新曲公演に向けて、準備が進んでいる。\n早く美希に、これを届けないとな！）", "zh": "（为了美希的新歌公演，准备工作正在顺利进行。\n得赶快把这个交到美希手里才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_071_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "9900b2b7635941679255037e8de001abe410526657940f0f54b6503853908028", "ja": "つまりー。\n昴くん、失恋したことないんだ？", "zh": "也就是说——\n昴，你从来没有失恋过？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_071_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "244ae51c8712f47fdc16c0810dd34376e6632a5edb76abec63385aeba7083a3a", "ja": "わ、悪いか？　恋は前に勉強したけど、失恋なんて……\nていうか、そんなの聞いてどうすんだ？", "zh": "不、不行吗？恋爱之前是学习过了，失恋什么的……\n话说回来，你问这个想干嘛啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_071_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "756be7de603df8cf4efcd078d07f81fa240ba41635b2599c5ecce88343573f15", "ja": "あのね。今度のミキの新曲、すっごい失恋ソング\nなんだって。だから、ミキもお勉強なの！", "zh": "那个啊，美希这次的新歌，据说是超级失恋歌曲。所以，美希也要学习一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_071_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "8dcc7f064a6b46f7b41b1434c36c80db76156e5a7b6707817f0473f72c82eb8a", "ja": "さすが美希ちゃん、えらいわね♪　でも、すっごい\n失恋ソングかぁ……。何がすごいのかしら？？？", "zh": "不愧是美希，真了不起呢♪　不过，超厉害的失恋歌吗……到底厉害在哪里呢？？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_071_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "91d50f3acf801c9a0fd5755e25e103b5681bb14f10af110f234a49023767b3e0", "ja": "わかんないの。ミキも昴くんと同じだから。\n失恋させちゃうばっかりで、したことないし。", "zh": "我也不知道呀。因为美希和昴一样嘛。\n总是让别人失恋，自己可从来没经历过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_071_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "994fda9b656b0a314b32c2b48afc417c708bc8155a8535b9b9f7d9ef22b13d15", "ja": "オレはさせたこともないって！\nあ、でも莉緒なら知ってるんじゃないか？　大人だし！", "zh": "我可是连让人失恋都没做过啊！\n啊，不过莉绪应该知道吧？毕竟她是大人嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_071_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "7595e004c5107e6abe64e7d87b25e8191bd2dd97009eb6ba99793e2dea4c6fd4", "ja": "え？　わ、私！？\nええっと、そうね……ど、どうだったかしら～～？", "zh": "诶？我、我吗！？\n呃，这个嘛……到、到底是怎样来着～～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_071_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0fcbfb9fe76f48296755712018aec280b68c860b91826330ec600237936c7165", "ja": "おっ、美希、さっそく頑張ってるみたいだな。\n昴と莉緒も、お疲れさま！", "zh": "哦，美希，这么快就已经在努力了啊。\n昴和莉绪也辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_071_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "9f5d93de9eb137e9c4fbbdfdf07ac6c31f6b2f0ef26b3fd01587df9018d2597a", "ja": "{$P$}、おはようなの！\nどうだった？　もうできてた？", "zh": "{$P$}，早上好呀！怎么样？已经做好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_071_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b857bdb90e549d1815d1e96a3f8935129a42d2cd9c13c20d0f527b7716c6f062", "ja": "ああ、美希の新曲、今さっき届いたよ。\nせっかくだから、みんなでデモを聞いてみよう！", "zh": "啊，美希的新歌刚刚送到了。\n难得有这个机会，大家一起听听试听曲吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_071_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d087b7477d0f5783afc7e08b36b26e95e32e9d9ce011955cc56b1fc6eb2a1a64", "ja": "……先方と何度もやりとりして、\nかなり苦労したけど……ようやく完成だ。", "zh": "……和对方反复沟通了好多次，费了不少功夫……总算完成了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_071_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "e285878d2f96e436110eba3718ef20353dcf668237b10429e66f11cb2b68a4cd", "ja": "わぁ……、すっげー！　カッコイイ～～！\nこれ美希が歌うんだろ？　すっっげーー！！", "zh": "哇……太厉害了！好帅气啊～～！\n这是美希要唱的对吧？太太太厉害啦——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_071_1014_046rio", "source_sha256": "dd98242b3c4c339de403c8947ae76b217b0753a874e765d659e365a326e027db", "ja": "ドラマティック～！　情熱的で激しくて……。\nんもう、お姉さんきゅんきゅんしちゃう～！", "zh": "太戏剧性了～！又热情又激烈……  \n真是的，姐姐的心都怦怦直跳了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_071_1015_p", "source_sha256": "af7670364d61cb0885bee34895a9673bbc9cbb48b457f978c86a9f6001e5fd93", "ja": "よかった、昴と莉緒には大好評だな！\n……で、どうだ、美希？", "zh": "太好了，昴和莉绪都非常喜欢啊！\n……那么，你觉得怎么样，美希？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_071_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "4d3c7a3add7e8cd672a557e404301c85486b9033989e94834866dd2af784175e", "ja": "……うん。すっごくいいカンジ……。\nこれ、ミキのために作ってくれたんだよね……？", "zh": "……嗯。感觉特别棒……。\n这是专门为美希创作的，对吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_071_1017_p", "source_sha256": "d0bc658a25577dd859021e927b51afec84b80fa6b27d44884ea78b63a7ee58e3", "ja": "もちろん。ステージの美希に、思いっきり\n輝いてもらおうと思って作った曲なんだ。", "zh": "当然了。这是为了让舞台上的美希能尽情闪耀，\n才创作出的曲子啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_071_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "e5fc78bddea6263e73078215b1cb804facb5931ed9741ac1aaefeba687dab44b", "ja": "うれしい……ありがとうなの。ミキ、絶対ちゃんと\n歌うね。ミキの、本気の気持ちを込めて……。", "zh": "好开心……谢谢你。美希一定会好好\n唱的。倾注美希真正的心意……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_071_1019_003mik", "source_sha256": "84f30342672c7126f7bec46298c7474803772f4b485d563140fcf41766ab27f1", "ja": "気持ち……。ミキの、本気の……\n恋の気持ちと、向き合って……。", "zh": "感情……美希的、真正的……\n直面于恋爱的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_071_1020_p", "source_sha256": "6ec35fa1a592e29c3bba95e0fb70b09a15d708d4eda9acfc3c20a9c0e7ead2fd", "ja": "美希？　どうかしたのか？", "zh": "美希？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_071_1021_003mik", "source_sha256": "59fd3e80f27cdf94392b9483fe860bcd63c007ea8356be06afa6a6fe2ae60dd0", "ja": "だから……。うん、言ってみる。\nあのね。……あのね、ハニー。", "zh": "所以……嗯，我说出来。\n那个……那个，亲爱的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_071_1022_p", "source_sha256": "9caa9b427df681db372efe4f7c6dbfbe4b5fb30f42b57fd8791634870d8ab4ba", "ja": "うん？　……うん！？", "zh": "嗯？……嗯！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_071_1025_003mik", "source_sha256": "fe28c76305b114b0fa507778da2418e08b70c187dd5ac360f25ac73563066889", "ja": "……大好き！\nミキと、付き合ってくださいっ！", "zh": "……最喜欢你了！\n请和美希交往吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_071_1026_046rio", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_071_1027_047sub", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_071_1028_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_071_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_071_1029_047sub", "source_sha256": "9011f11e923b1bb2e1e9b7a68455b80493ae6ad6541c7c23fe730e33dcfc3c79", "ja": "えええええええええええええええ～！？", "zh": "欸欸欸欸欸欸欸欸欸欸欸欸欸欸～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
